title: Cloudflare Workers Global
agents: cloudflare
catalog: cloud/cloudflare
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the overall Cloudflare Workers usage for the account.
 It reports daily request counts against the Free Tier limit (100k/day),
 monthly request totals, and CPU time consumption.
 Free-tier monitoring can be disabled in the ruleset.

discovery:
 One service is created per Cloudflare account.
